<title>THAILAND: STA Group to close subsidiary from August 1.</title>
<headline>STA Group to close subsidiary from August 1.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ailing furniture group STA Group (1993) Plc said on Wednesday it would close a subsidiary from August 1 due to cash-flow constraints.</p>
<p>&quot;STA Group informed one of its subsidiaries, STA Furniture Group Co Ltd, producing parwood and particle made furniture, would be temporarily shut down,&quot; STA said in a statement.</p>
<p>It was not clear how many staff would be affected by the closure, or for how long the subsidiary will be closed.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
